/*
  Космос (Kosmos) theme - the Soviet space programme of the 1970s, as the retro
  future saw it: Soyuz, Sputnik and Venera.

  The FlapXCoin layout in cosmic navy, with see-through panels framed in Soviet
  red, solid red title tabs, red buttons and selected page, star gold for
  amounts, and bold white text throughout. The base colours come from
  the theme table in guiutil.cpp; behind the main window is the Kosmos picture
  (res/images/kosmos.jpg). The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables.
*/

